{
  "id": "erek_start",
  "start": [
    { "node": "repeat_narration", "when": { "flag": "erek_talked", "equals": 1 } },
    { "node": "first_narration" }
  ],
  "speakers": [
    { "id": "player", "name": "Banec", "role": "player",
      "portrait": "assets/ui/portraits/player.png" },
    { "id": "erek", "name": "Erek Stonebreaker", "role": "npc", "entity": "erek",
      "portrait": "assets/ui/portraits/erek.png" },
    { "id": "silverhair", "name": "Imoen Silverhair", "role": "npc" },
    { "id": "bjarn", "name": "Bjarn Fingolson", "role": "npc" },
    { "id": "narrator", "name": "Narrator", "role": "narrator" }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "first_narration", "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Before you stands a young Dwarf, with an open face and no sign of the traditional beard. His expression shows his intelligence and a trace of humour as he watches you expectantly.",
      "next": "identify"
    },
    {
      "id": "identify", "speaker": "player",
      "text": "You are Erek Stonebreaker, aren't you?",
      "next": "erek_identity"
    },
    {
      "id": "erek_identity", "speaker": "erek",
      "text": "That I am. Erek Stonebreaker, aspirant to the trading business and Master Fingolson's apprentice. But I seem to not remember you, sir.",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "I am Banec.",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "erek_talked", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "business_redirect" },
        { "text": "I am Banec, Lady Silverhair's man. I have some questions.",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "erek_talked", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "incident" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_redirect", "speaker": "erek",
      "text": "Well met then, Banec. Only I fear that you would be better advised to talk to Master Fingolson, if you intend to do business.",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "Actually, that isn't the case. I would like to speak to you about Lady Silverhair.", "next": "incident" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "incident", "speaker": "erek",
      "text": "I understand. You have learned of the ... incident, but as I can see, you fail to believe it.",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "You believe Lady Silverhair is innocent then?", "next": "uncertain" },
        { "text": "Well, what do you believe, Erek?", "next": "uncertain" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uncertain", "speaker": "erek",
      "text": "Master Fingolson says her guilt is proven beyond doubt, and there are indeed facts that support his opinion. But I ... am not sure.",
      "next": "main_menu"
    },
    {
      "id": "repeat_narration", "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Erek gives you a welcoming nod as you approach.",
      "next": "main_menu"
    },
    {
      "id": "main_menu", "speaker": "erek",
      "text": "Ho there, Banec. What is it this time?",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "Could you please repeat what you told me about the argument between your master and Lady Silverhair?", "next": "argument_intro" },
        { "text": "Did you pack Master Fingolson's gems that evening, Erek?",
          "when": { "flag": "ask_packed_gems", "equals": 1 },
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "ask_packed_gems", "value": 2 }],
          "next": "packed_answer" },
        { "text": "Nothing really. Until later, Erek.", "next": "goodbye" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "argument_intro", "speaker": "erek",
      "text": "She intended to buy some rare gems, but it seemed she had underestimated their value. She was quite surprised by my Master's offer:",
      "next": "silverhair_offer"
    },
    {
      "id": "silverhair_offer", "speaker": "silverhair",
      "text": "Why, Master Fingolson, this is outrageous. 'Tis twice as much as I would spend for stones of a superior quality. Do you believe I have never traded for Chrysoberyls before?",
      "next": "bjarn_price"
    },
    {
      "id": "bjarn_price", "speaker": "bjarn",
      "text": "My Lady, these Catseyes are very rare. I doubt that you could aquire anything of that quality for the price I'm willing to grant you.",
      "next": "silverhair_counter"
    },
    {
      "id": "silverhair_counter", "speaker": "silverhair",
      "text": "Now Master Fingolson, you call these Catseyes? They are mere Cymophanes. Good gods! I am no Dwarf, but I do know my gems. My offer is 200, for all the good they will be to me as reagents.",
      "next": "bjarn_counter"
    },
    {
      "id": "bjarn_counter", "speaker": "bjarn",
      "text": "You call me a liar? As if I couldn't tell a Catseye and a Cymophane apart. Even young Erek here can. 700 and no less. Take it or leave it.",
      "next": "silverhair_final"
    },
    {
      "id": "silverhair_final", "speaker": "silverhair",
      "text": "Ha! A liar and a thief you are indeed, Master Fingolson. But, I need the stones far more than justice against a Dwarven cheat. 300 is my final offer, and that is more than this rubbish deserves!",
      "next": "bjarn_refusal"
    },
    {
      "id": "bjarn_refusal", "speaker": "bjarn",
      "text": "Do not try to charm me, Mistress Silverhair. My prize is set. Think about it.",
      "next": "silverhair_leaves"
    },
    {
      "id": "silverhair_leaves", "speaker": "silverhair",
      "text": "You are but making profit off my need. I will think about it, but to be frank, you deserve not a single gold piece!",
      "next": "erek_end_argument"
    },
    {
      "id": "erek_end_argument", "speaker": "erek",
      "text": "And with that, she left us alone.",
      "next": "main_menu"
    },
    {
      "id": "packed_answer", "speaker": "erek",
      "text": "Me? What a curious idea! My master wouldn't give them out of his hands. I only packed our clothes and other equipment; after the master went to bed.",
      "next": "packed_followup"
    },
    {
      "id": "packed_followup", "speaker": "player",
      "text": "And the gems were not in your luggage when you packed, right?",
      "next": "packed_denial"
    },
    {
      "id": "packed_denial", "speaker": "erek",
      "text": "What do you mean? No ... they weren't. Of course not!",
      "next": "main_menu"
    },
    {
      "id": "goodbye", "speaker": "player",
      "text": "Nothing really. Until later, Erek.",
      "end": true
    }
  ]
}
